<Layout title="Experience">
  <h1>Experience</h1>

  <h2>Monkey Strike Games — Technical Lead / Graduate Programmer</h2>
  <p><em>Sep. 2025 – Present</em></p>

  <img src="/experience/monkey-strike-logo.png" alt="Monkey Strike Games logo" style="max-width: 200px; margin: 1rem 0;" />

  <p>
    Technical Lead at Monkey Strike Games, a startup studio, where my work spans
    the full pipeline: infrastructure (Perforce, Jenkins, VPN), rendering
    optimization and baked lighting, and Steam platform integration built
    largely from scratch since Unreal's official plugins didn't cover what
    the team needed.
  </p>

  <h3>Pizzapocalypse 2</h3>
  <img src="/experience/pizzapocalypse2-thumbnail.jpg" alt="Pizzapocalypse 2 thumbnail" style="max-width: 400px; margin: 1rem 0;" />
  <p>
    A UE5.6 production. Set up and maintain the studio's Jenkins CI/CD pipeline
    and Perforce infrastructure, built a Jenkins-triggered automated profiling
    pipeline with input record/replay, and implemented PSO precaching/bundling
    to cut down shader-compilation stutter. Also own rendering optimization for
    forward-shaded, densely set-dressed levels — shadow culling, HISM/ISM
    tooling, and baked lighting — plus a custom Steam Input plugin built from
    scratch.
  </p>
